@startuml command_http_flow
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d84dd3d6 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeSessionController.java getSession.
' Architecture change: Builtin routes return JSON; B13/B14 Skill reuses the message SSE boundary.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@6f52fddc modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/service/command/CompositeCommandRegistry.java resolve.
' Product decision: GET uses full sources and state-filtered commands with name/type/description/hints; POST keeps locked admission.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d8e22562 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/AgentRuntimeManager.java prepareCached and toRuntime.
' Product decision: Help uses authored Agent metadata; it does not format the command catalog.
' Presentation: one responsibility-level scenario; implementation details remain in the linked document.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #425B70
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #BAC4CC
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #8496A4
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FAFBFC
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #BAC4CC
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEF
skinparam noteBorderColor #D2C6A5
hide footbox
autonumber

title Execute One Resolved Command - Pending implementation
actor Caller
participant "Command application" as App
participant "Command catalog" as Catalog
participant "Selected handler" as Handler
participant "Domain service" as Service
Caller -> App : Submit command and arguments
App -> Catalog : Resolve once with required source scope
Catalog --> App : Real definition and immutable catalog
App -> Handler : Dispatch selected definition and snapshot
Handler -> Service : Apply command-specific admission and action
Service --> Handler : Typed outcome
Handler --> App : Command result
alt Builtin
  App --> Caller : Command-specific JSON
else Skill
  App --> Caller : User receipt, shared events and matching idle
end
note over App,Service
  GET catalog is a separate read-only operation.
  Help uses cached Agent metadata; no model execution.
  Skill reuses ordinary message admission.
end note
@enduml

@startuml command_authoritative_state
title Pending implementation Command Recovery Boundary
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d84dd3d6 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/resources/db/gaussdb/install/session_schema.sql.
' Design reason: synchronous JSON results need no generic command lifecycle storage.
skinparam shadowing false
rectangle "Name" as Name
rectangle "Model / Thinking / Compact" as Domain
database "Current Session state" as State
database "Existing domain Entries" as Entries
rectangle "GET Session / GET Events" as Query
Name --> State : displayName and version only
Domain --> State : atomic state changes
Domain --> Entries : append only when changed
Query --> State
Query --> Entries
note bottom
No commandId, command.started, command.completed, command.failed,
or session.name.changed sidecar.
end note
@enduml
